flowchart TB

CARD["Proposal card<br/>ranked candidate · legs in order ·<br/>projected HF · what was not verified ·<br/>approval scope"]
MOD{"User modifies?"}
REPROMPT["Conversational refinement<br/><i>'make it 1.4'</i> · full re-solve ·<br/><b>never an editable amount field</b>"]
APPROVE(["User approves — the only edge<br/>that authorises anything"])
REVAL{"Revalidate:<br/>fresh prices,<br/>floor still holds?"}
DRIFTED["Re-propose<br/><b>never execute a stale size</b>"]
AUTO{"Auto-sign armed<br/>AND within cap?"}
WALLET["Wallet signature per leg<br/>user signs the built XDR"]
DIRECT["Executes with no prompt<br/>inside the daily cap"]
SUBMIT["Submit · confirm settlement<br/><b>code decides settled, not the model</b>"]
NEXT{"More legs?"}
FAIL{"Leg failed?"}
RESUME["Offer resume of the remainder<br/>carrying every slot the leg had<br/><b>settled legs never replayed</b>"]
RECEIPT(["Receipt · what landed,<br/>what did not"])

CARD --> MOD
MOD -->|yes| REPROMPT --> CARD
MOD -->|no| APPROVE --> REVAL
REVAL -->|drifted| DRIFTED
REVAL -->|holds| AUTO
AUTO -->|no, or over cap| WALLET --> SUBMIT
AUTO -->|yes| DIRECT --> SUBMIT
SUBMIT --> FAIL
FAIL -->|yes| RESUME
FAIL -->|no| NEXT
NEXT -->|yes| AUTO
NEXT -->|no| RECEIPT
